(86, 'REQUIREMENT', 'CH01-R024', 'Part Three', 'Chapter 1: Luxury Hotels', 'Luxury Hotels (General)', 'Table No. (2): Other Security Requirements', '24', 37, 37, 'Room Entry System: Electronic room lock system capable of recording at least 1,500 movements or retaining logs for 6 months.'),
(87, 'REQUIREMENT', 'CH01-R025', 'Part Three', 'Chapter 1: Luxury Hotels', 'Luxury Hotels (General)', 'Table No. (2): Other Security Requirements', '25', 37, 37, 'Surveillance Room: Dedicated security control room meeting SIRA technical specifications.'),
