(722, 'REQUIREMENT', 'CH35-R008', 'Part Three', 'Chapter 35: Business Centers', 'Business Centers', 'Table No. (2): Other Security Requirements', '8', 127, 127, 'Electronic Connectivity with SIRA: Electronic system health monitoring connection with SIRA.');
