(725, 'REQUIREMENT', 'CH36-R003', 'Part Three', 'Chapter 36: Quran Memorization Centers and Islamic Institutions', 'Quran Memorization Centers and Islamic Institutions', 'Table No. (1): VSS Requirements', '3', 128, 128, 'Location: Corridors on all floors | Field of View: DETECTION | Remarks: Minimum 60-day recording retention'),
